    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 的 SQL/PGQ 已能表达异构图",
      "summary": "Hans-Jürgen Schönig 演示了用 PostgreSQL 19 的 SQL/PGQ 建异构图：一个属性图里同时有 person、company 两类顶点和 knows、works_at 两类边，跨表关系照常查。他也点出眼下的限制，MATCH 子句还不支持逗号分隔的多个路径模式，替代做法是把多个 GRAPH_TABLE 子查询按 ID 列连接。另有两个坑：多标签图里用匿名边会悄悄合并所有边类型，可变长度路径也还没实现。",
      "url": "https://www.cybertec-postgresql.com/en/heterogeneous-graphs-in-sql-pgq-on-postgresql-19/",
      "author": "Hans-Jürgen Schönig",
      "source": "CYBERTEC",
      "source_date": "2026-06-25",
      "image": "https://www.cybertec-postgresql.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/CYBERTEC-Blog-Graph-Relationship-Series-Heterogeneous-Graphs-in-SQLPGQ-on-PostgreSQL-19-Hans.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
